#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Drupal Cache Management"
msgstr "Maamulka Drupal Cache"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Clears all cached data from Drupal. This includes page caches, render caches, and compiled templates. Use this when you see outdated content or after making configuration changes that are not reflected on the site. Note, this does not affect CDN cache, browser cache, or middleware API wrapper cache."
msgstr "Waxaaysa dhammaan xogta cached ee Drupal. Tani waxa uu ka mid yahay caashada bogga, caashada reer, iyo shabladaha soo saaray. Isticmaalin tan marka aad arko waxyaabaha hore ama kaddib u sameeyey isbedelada sameynta oo aan goobta ka muujin. Xog gelin, tani ma saameyn CDN cache, cache browser, ama middleware API wrapper cache."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Rebuild Drupal Cache"
msgstr "Dib dib u dhiska Drupal Cache"

